{"author":{"id":"6c7374a500bfd4cb191ae45b3f9d4b7a3d9d7f0324d04add217e8cbefeb7e1b9"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1791727229,"nonce":"i9+3TX2slfRWHN4ASDqWVzPDFWk=","title":"CSS and element gaps against blinc_ts","message":"Compared with blinc_ts on 2026-10-11 (blinc_ts main aa78c55); both share blinc_abi's selector engine, so selectors, pseudo-classes and at-rules match.\n\n**ashui lacks, blinc_ts has**\n- text-decoration and longhands, text-underline-offset (blinc_abi draws them; ashui never sets them), and UA underlines for a, u/ins, s/del, abbr[title]\n- visibility; cursor; pointer-events\n- order, align-content, justify-items, justify-self; % padding and margin (ashui throws); position: fixed (as absolute)\n- background-repeat, background-position for url() backgrounds; object-fit and list-style-type as CSS properties (ashui: classes and props)\n- scrollbar-color, scrollbar-width\n- section, header, footer, nav, main, article, aside (\"unknown tag\" in ashui)\n- dialog: cancel event, closedby=\"any\", form method=dialog\n- tables sized by content (ashui gives columns equal shares)\n- a [hidden] UA rule\n\n**blinc_ts lacks, ashui has**\n- overflow-wrap, word-wrap, word-break; calc() with px terms; pointer queries\n\n**Both lack**\n- position: sticky, z-index, display inline-block/inline-flex/contents\n- text-overflow: ellipsis, line-clamp, text-transform, text-indent, word-spacing, vertical-align\n- ::before/::after with content, ::marker, ::selection; @font-face, @container, @supports, @layer\n- rowspan, border-collapse/spacing; select multiple/size; date, time, file, color inputs\n- dashed and dotted borders, conic and repeating gradients, elliptical border-radius\n- user-select, caret-color, accent-color, outline-style, object-position, scroll-snap, mix-blend-mode","files":null}]}